  "rulings": [
    "The land gate faces south. The Marquis Road comes along the Mordava's north bank and turns up to it.",
    "Kordavos is an estuary port. The Mordava runs west along the south wall and widens into the harbour on the Jade Sea.",
    "The Asterian Quarter holds the high ground in the north-east, across the city from the docks.",
    "Two squares: the harvest square inside the gate, and the grand square before the Blackthorn Mansion. The ballroom balcony faces the garden, a front balcony faces the square.",
    "The docks are their own waterfront district. The Lower Districts lie past them along the quay and climb behind them.",
    "The city climbs from the harbour and river, low in the south-west, to the Asterian heights in the north-east.",
    "The castle appears only in the 3D sets. It stands on the hill crown above the Asterian Quarter.",
    "Warehouse 14 stands at the west end of the docks, behind the warehouses on the quay. The Star of Faelendar is moored off it.",
    "The Mordava pier and the river pier are one pier, at the docks' east end where the river meets the harbour.",
    "The temple has no surface entrance on the map. Joran's way in stays unstated.",
    "\"The heart of Kordavos\" for the inn and the mansion is loose wording and does not bind the map."
  ],
